    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried that. it doesn't really matter though. holding something warm or sitting outside... it's just a way to pass the time while the body breaks down. it feels like i'm just watching a movie of someone else's life. i've lost my grip on everything. it's exhausting to just... exist when there's nothing left to do but wait.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
