      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right—it can feel like a hollow ritual when the connection to yourself is gone. That exhaustion is a sign of how much you've been carrying, not a failure. Maybe the waiting isn't about doing something, but about letting yourself be still without judgment. If you can't feel your hands, that's okay—just let them rest. You don't have to fix anything right now.",
